# Loadpath mappings.
#   - `. AufbauVerif`       lets the compiler (and vsrocq) assign the right
#                           logical name to source .v files in this directory.
#   - `.build AufbauVerif`  is where `make build` puts compiled artifacts;
#                           dependent compilations and vsrocq resolve
#                           `From AufbauVerif Require Import …` through here.
-Q . AufbauVerif
-Q .build AufbauVerif

# Compile order (the Makefile feeds these to `rocq compile` sequentially):
#
#   core         — shared syntactic types
#   domain       — ConstraintDomain interface
#   gen_domain   — GenDomain interface (extends ConstraintDomain)
#   generation   — Generation functor (the algorithm)
#   trivial      — trivial instantiation, smoke test
#   sanity       — independent toolchain smoke test

core.v
domain.v
gen_domain.v
generation.v
trivial.v
sanity.v
